    {
      "text": "Preheat the air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry potatoes. Trim edges to make a flat surface on both ends.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P30nFLHS0Zr0CyDuvWMU64bquV0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282437-AirFryerOneBiteRoastedPotatoes-mfs-Step1-3235-4x3-2252f2b09ac44f0db643813d010bcb48.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282437/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine extra-virgin olive oil and salad dressing mix in a large bowl. Add potatoes and toss until potatoes are well coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ERht0IbzfBCZgG8Ch2e7c8Tw-Ow=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282437-AirFryerOneBiteRoastedPotatoes-mfs-Step3-3239-4x3-0fb6ef435f0b4cf99e23a65b51407c75.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282437/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place in a single layer into the air fryer basket. Cook in batches if necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kkDdDfQvUDCJgZpDzRznbJlXMXY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282437-AirFryerOneBiteRoastedPotatoes-mfs-Step4-3241-4x3-0e240f4d0ae0427a9ecc7a36f122031a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282437/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Air fry until potatoes are golden brown, 5 to 7 minutes. Flip potatoes and air fry for an additional 2 to 3 minutes. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
